issue_context.body:
**Describe the bug**
Transceive function lock forever when the SPI configuration failed

**To Reproduce**
A SPI device with a wrong baudrate must be set. For example
```
&spi1 {
	status = "okay";
	lmp90100: lmp90100@0 {
		compatible = "ti,lmp90100";
		reg = <0x0>;
		spi-max-frequency = <10>;
		....		
	};
};
```
The first transceive failed with: `Unsupported frequency 10Hz, max 8000000Hz, min 62500Hz`
The next transceive lock forever
